  tutorials:
  - section: 0
    formula: Subject|Verb 2|Object / Keterangan
    explanation: "Semua subject memakai Verb 2 (bentuk lampau).   Regular: + ed (play
      \u2192 played).   Irregular berubah bentuk (go \u2192 went, eat \u2192 ate)."
    exampleSentence: I-played-football-yesterday
    exampleRoles: Subject|Verb 2|Object|Keterangan
  - section: 1
    formula: Subject|did|not|Verb 1|Object / Keterangan
    explanation: 'Semua subject memakai did not.   Setelah did, verb kembali ke bentuk
      dasar: did not go (bukan went).'
    exampleSentence: He-did-not-come
    exampleRoles: Subject|did|not|Verb 1
  - section: 2
    formula: Did|Subject|Verb 1|Object / Keterangan + ?
    explanation: Did dipakai untuk semua subject dan diletakkan di depan.   Verb
      kembali ke bentuk dasar dan kalimat diakhiri tanda tanya (?).
    exampleSentence: Did-you-see-it?
    exampleRoles: Did|Subject|Verb 1|Object + ?
